flowchart LR
 WEB[Telegram webhook] --> BOT[Bot Adapter]
 BOT --> D[Диалог FSM]
 D --> EX[Intent + Slot extractor]
 EX --> L[Внешняя LLM]
 D --> PROFILE[Profile / exclusions]
 D --> SEARCH[Поиск]
 SEARCH --> FILTER[SQL hard filters]
 FILTER --> HYBRID[FTS + vector + RRF]
 HYBRID --> DIVERSE[Diversity + soft profile ranking]
 DIVERSE --> VALID[Final validator]
 VALID --> CATALOG[Опубликовано Каталог snapshots]
 D --> COMPOSE[Template card composer]
 COMPOSE --> OUTBOX[Telegram outbox]
 OUTBOX --> SENDER[Sender worker]
 ADMIN[SQLAdmin custom actions] --> CATALOG
 CATALOG --> INDEX[Index job]
